k.com/Timberkala\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Facebook\" class=\"inova-social-link\">\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z\"/></svg>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://in.pinterest.com/timberkala/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Pinterest\" class=\"inova-social-link\">\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"16\"/><path d=\"M12 2a8 8 0 0 0-8 8c0 3.5 2.2 6.5 5.5 7.6-.1-.7-.1-1.7.1-2.4l1.3-5.4s-.3-.6-.3-1.6c0-1.5.9-2.7 2-2.7 1 0 1.4.7 1.4 1.6 0 1-.6 2.5-1 3.9-.3 1.2.6 2.2 1.8 2.2 2.1 0 3.7-2.3 3.7-5.5 0-2.9-2.1-4.9-5-4.9-3.4 0-5.5 2.6-5.5 5.3 0 1 .4 2.2.9 2.8.1.1.1.2.1.3l-.3 1.3c0 .2-.2.3-.4.2-1.7-.8-2.7-3.2-2.7-5.1 0-4.1 3-7.9 8.7-7.9 4.6 0 8.1 3.3 8.1 7.6 0 4.5-2.8 8.2-6.8 8.2-1.3 0-2.6-.7-3-1.5l-.8 3.2c-.3 1.2-1.1 2.7-1.7 3.6A9.9 9.9 0 0 0 12 22a10 10 0 0 0 10-10A10 10 0 0 0 12 2z\"/></svg>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@timberkala\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"YouTube\" class=\"inova-social-link\">\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22.54 6.42a2.78 2.78 0 0 0-1.94-2C18.88 4 12 4 12 4s-6.88 0-8.6.46a2.78 2.78 0 0 0-1.94 2A29 29 0 0 0 1 11.75a29 29 0 0 0 .46 5.33A2.78 2.78 0 0 0 3.4 19c1.72.46 8.6.46 8.6.46s6.88 0 8.6-.46a2.78 2.78 0 0 0 1.94-2 29 29 0 0 0 .46-5.25 29 29 0 0 0-.46-5.33z\"/><polygon points=\"9.75 15.02 15.5 11.75 9.75 8.48 9.75 15.02\"/></svg>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Collections -->\n      <div class=\"inova-footer-col\">\n        